    stimulus:
      'Dr. Ito: The city\u2019s new reflective-pavement program will lower summer street temperatures by several degrees. Laboratory tests show the coating reflects 40 percent more sunlight than asphalt.\n\nDr. Okafor: Laboratory tests don\u2019t settle the question. The coating degrades within two years under heavy traffic, and the city\u2019s streets carry far more traffic than the test roads did. The program will not deliver the promised cooling.',
