      'CEO: Our shift to remote work has boosted productivity, and the quarterly numbers prove it. Output per employee is up eleven percent since the change.\n\nUnion representative: Output is up because the remaining staff are covering for colleagues who were laid off in the same quarter. Per-employee output rose, but total output barely moved, and burnout complaints have tripled.',
